## Source-isolation declaration

This runtime pack contains no source text, evidence excerpts, source locators, author or book identity, source-specific proper nouns, character/world mappings, or recoverable plot outline. The private audit that justified this contract is not a runtime dependency.

## Portability and change control

- Projects must copy and lock this pack rather than link to a mutable upstream directory.
- Any contract change requires a version increment and a drift/source-isolation regression check.
- `BLOCKED` packs must not be used to create or write a production novel project.
